                                "sense_id": "e5ef5b7c-c2c5-3abe-949b-84af60e8620b",
                                "text": "As much so as possible; they have hardly a way that you would like, my dear ma'am; and are as closemouthed as if they were afraid of committing themselves."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a0764590-a5b7-4af6-b8e6-d69da17a0bd9",
                                "sense_id": "e5ef5b7c-c2c5-3abe-949b-84af60e8620b",
                                "text": "Instructors were notoriously closemouthed about their gunnery techniques."
                            }
                        ]
